# Redesign r10

If your task is in **Phase RD** of `docs/ROADMAP.md` (ACC-178 to ACC-193),
`docs/REDESIGN.md` is your brief. It sets the order, the file ownership, the
worktree and claim protocol, and which agent and model to use. `DESIGN.md` is
the spec.

Until ACC-179 is `[x]`, `design/source/boa_design_v2.html` is still the pixel
contract and rule `20-ui.mdc` applies unchanged. Do not start any RD build
task before then.

For one RD task, delegate to the subagent named in REDESIGN.md section 4
(`/cursor-rd-builder`, `/cursor-rd-mechanic`). Run `/cursor-rd-verify` before
merging, and `/cursor-rd-reviewer` where section 5 says to. The gate tasks,
ACC-189 and ACC-190, belong to Claude Code: do not take them in Cursor unless
Claude Code has blocked them with `task block`.
